26
00:01:32,119 --> 00:01:36,152
Check the actual card and deployment
conditions before you put a catalog

27
00:01:36,187 --> 00:01:38,442
model on your team's available list.

28
00:01:39,908 --> 00:01:45,480
Now return to the software you use. Open
Copilot Chat in VS Code and expand the

29
00:01:45,480 --> 00:01:46,497
