36
00:02:07,963 --> 00:02:10,730
Preview on the card describes the
provider’s offering.

37
00:02:11,086 --> 00:02:15,290
Your company’s policy, plan, and
configured provider determine whether

38
00:02:15,290 --> 00:02:16,196
