39
00:02:16,580 --> 00:02:21,115
Put both observations in your note. A
colleague can then tell the difference

40
00:02:21,115 --> 00:02:24,944
between a catalog announcement and an
option they can use today.

41
00:02:26,513 --> 00:02:30,414
Make one inventory entry for the class.
Include the maker,

42
00:02:30,626 --> 00:02:33,860
the exact version or label, the client
and environment,

43
00:02:34,115 --> 00:02:35,171
and the date you checked.

44
00:02:35,572 --> 00:02:38,280
If the picker changes later, repeat that
short check.

45
